00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.073
Thank you.

00:04:29.073 --> 00:04:31.430
Not a good idea because your body

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.515
is already saying that
it doesn't like milk.

00:04:33.515 --> 00:04:35.340
When you're lactose intolerant,

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.780
you're not having an autoimmune reaction.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:40.880
