enzyme that breaks down

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.660
the sugar component of
milk which is lactose

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:46.540
and the enzyme that
you're missing is lactase.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.072
Sometimes people do well with a pill form

00:04:50.072 --> 00:04:52.028
of the enzyme lactase.

00:04:52.028 --> 00:04:53.700
